{title: Soft Spot}
{artist: Keshi}
{capo: 4}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Gmaj7]I don't go out, but I’ll [Gmaj7/F#]do it for you
[Em9]You never liked it when I drink too much
[Dmaj11]I hate to dance, but I'll dance with you
[C]'Cause I’d do [Cm]anything to feel your touch [*(maj7)]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_bridge: Pre-Chorus}
