[Gmaj7]Baby, can’t you see?
I ne[Gmaj7/F#]ed you 'cause you’re[Em9] everything that I'm not
You know I got a [Dmaj11]soft spot for you
You know I got a [C]soft spot for [Cm]you [*(maj7)]
{end_of_chorus}

